## Limitations

The model's predictions depend on the dataset, category distribution, and text preprocessing methods. Some categories may be harder to classify because of limited examples or similarities in article content. Sentiment analysis and entity recognition may also make errors depending on context and wording.

This project is an educational prototype and should not be treated as a fully automated news verification system.

